{"suttaId":"thi-ap12","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[7002,7024],"vripara":"22"},"segments":{"thi-ap12:0.3":"Saḷalapupphikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap12:1.1":"“Candabhāgānadītīre, ahosiṃ kinnarī tadā;","thi-ap12:1.3":"Addasāhaṃ devadevaṃ, caṅkamantaṃ narāsabhaṃ.","thi-ap12:2.1":"“Ocinitvāna saḷalaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ;","thi-ap12:2.3":"Upasiṅghi mahāvīro, saḷalaṃ devagandhikaṃ.","thi-ap12:3.1":"“Paṭiggahetvā sambuddho, vipassī lokanāyako;","thi-ap12:3.3":"Upasiṅghi mahāvīro, pekkhamānāya me tadā.","thi-ap12:4.1":"“Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna, vanditvā dvipaduttamaṃ [dipaduttamaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)];","thi-ap12:4.3":"Sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, tato pabbatamāruhiṃ.","thi-ap12:5.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap12:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap12:6.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap12:7.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap12:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap12:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ saḷalapupphikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap12:10.1":"Saḷalapupphikātheriyāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
